  "description": "<p>Reported by Graeme West<br/>\n<a href=\"http://fedora-commons.1317035.n2.nabble.com/Large-datastream-ingest-issue-Bad-request-unable-to-fulfill-REST-API-request-java-lang-NumberFormatE-td5094256.htm\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://fedora-commons.1317035.n2.nabble.com/Large-datastream-ingest-issue-Bad-request-unable-to-fulfill-REST-API-request-java-lang-NumberFormatE-td5094256.htm</a></p>\n\n<p>Ingesting a file larger than 2GB fails with java.lang.NumberFormatException.</p>\n\n<p>The source of this is in RestUtil - <br/>\nrContent.size = Integer.parseInt(lengthHeaders.get(0));</p>\n\n<p>This should be long rather than int (along with inner class RequestContent size field and related methods).</p>",
